      {
        "statement_id": "TODA-S000002",
        "chapter": 1,
        "section": "Chapter I",
        "order_key": "2",
        "kind": "Proposition",
        "locator": "Proposition 1.2",
        "tex_label": "prop:1-2",
        "source_line": 687,
        "source_statement_tex": "\\leavevmode\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item[$0).$] $\\alpha$, $\\beta$, $\\gamma$ のうち, いずれかが $0$ なら,\n\\[\n\\{\\alpha,\\ \\Ex^n\\beta,\\ \\Ex^n\\gamma\\}_n\\equiv0.\n\\]\n\\item[$i).$] $\\alpha\\circ \\Ex^n\\beta=\\beta\\circ\\gamma=0$ のとき,\n\\[\n\\{\\alpha,\\ \\Ex^n\\beta,\\ \\Ex^n\\gamma\\}_n\\circ\\Ex^{n+1}\\delta\\ \\subset\\ \\{\\alpha,\\Ex^n \\beta, \\Ex^n(\\gamma\\circ\\delta)\\}_n.\n\\]\n\\item[$ii).$] $\\alpha\\circ \\Ex^n\\beta=\\beta\\circ\\gamma\\circ\\delta=0$ のとき,\n\\[\n\\{\\alpha,\\ \\Ex^n\\beta,\\ \\Ex^n(\\gamma\\circ\\delta)\\}_n\\ \\subset\\ \\{\\alpha,\\ \\Ex^n(\\beta\\circ\\gamma),\\ \\Ex^n\\delta\\}_n .\n\\]\n\\item[$iii).$] $\\alpha\\circ\\Ex^n\\beta\\circ\\Ex^n\\gamma=\\gamma\\circ\\delta=0$ なら,\n\\[\n\\{\\alpha\\circ\\Ex^n\\beta,\\ \\Ex^n\\gamma,\\ \\Ex^n\\delta)\\}_n\\ \\subset\\ \\{\\alpha,\\ \\Ex^n(\\beta\\circ\\gamma),\\ \\Ex^n\\delta\\}_n .\n\\]\n\\item[$iv).$] $\\beta\\circ\\Ex^n\\gamma=\\gamma\\circ\\delta=0$ のとき,\n\\[\n\\alpha\\circ\\{\\beta,\\ \\Ex^n\\gamma,\\ \\Ex^n\\delta\\}_n\\ \\subset\\ \\{\\alpha\\circ\\beta,\\ \\Ex^n\\gamma,\\ \\Ex^n\\delta\\}_n .\n\\]\n\\end{enumerate}",
        "statement_type": "composition_properties",
        "summary_en": "Five separate zero and composition inclusion properties of secondary compositions.",
        "hypotheses_en": "Specified zero-composite conditions for each clause.",
        "internal_clause_markers": [
          "$0).$",
          "$i).$",
          "$ii).$",
          "$iii).$",
          "$iv).$"
        ],
        "source_status": "unchecked",
        "transcription_review": "reviewed_against_supplied_tex",
        "search_status": "unconnected",
        "existing_component_keys": [],
